    rdfs:label "model output" ;
    prov:value "[{\"text\": \"**Lisbon \\u2013 Quick Brief (as of\\u202f2026\\u201110\\u201102)**  \\n\\n**Weather (current)**  \\n- Temperature: **21\\u202f\\u00b0C**  \\n- Condition: **clear sky**  \\n\\n**Facts**  \\n- Lisbon is the **capital and largest city** of Portugal.  \\n- It lies on the **Tagus (Tagus) estuary**, where the river meets the Atlantic Ocean.  \\n- The city\\u2019s historic centre (Alfama) climbs the hillside above the river, offering a mix of narrow alleys, traditional Fado houses, and historic landmarks such as **S\\u00e3o\\u202fJorge Castle** and the **Bel\\u00e9m Tower**.  \\n- Lisbon\\u2019s historic centre is a **UNESCO World Heritage site** (the \\u201cHills of Lisbon\\u201d cultural landscape).  \\n- The city was **founded around the 2nd\\u202fcentury\\u202fBC** as a Phoenician trading post, later becoming a major port in the Age of Discovery.  \\n\\n*All information sourced from the weather and facts agents.*\"}]" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/prov-ai/run/claude-agent-sdk/cc-20261002T072558/step/0x3b15145325a80a87> .

